sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Retailer as Retailer
    actor Staff as Authorized Staff

    participant Mobile as Retailer Mobile App
    participant Portal as Web Portal

    participant ARApi as RetailerReceivablesController
    participant PaymentApi as PaymentsController

    participant ARSvc as RetailerReceivableService
    participant PaymentSvc as PaymentService

    participant ARStore as RetailerReceivableStore
    participant PaymentStore as PaymentStore

    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 1 - VIEW SCOPED RECEIVABLE LIST
    %% ==========================================

    Note over Retailer,DB: PART 1 - VIEW SCOPED RETAILER RECEIVABLES

    Retailer->>+Mobile: Open Receivables and select filters

    Mobile->>+ARApi: List(filter)

    ARApi->>+ARSvc: ListAsync(filter, retailerUserId, ct)

    %% ==========================================
    %% 1. VALIDATE RECEIVABLE FILTER
    %% ==========================================

    ARSvc->>+ARSvc: Validate(filter)

    ARSvc-->>ARSvc: Validation result
    deactivate ARSvc

    alt Filter is invalid

        Note right of ARSvc: Return Validation error

    else Filter is valid

        %% ==========================================
        %% 2. DETERMINE CURRENT BUSINESS DATE
        %% ==========================================

        ARSvc->>+ARSvc: Today()

        ARSvc-->>ARSvc: Current business date
        deactivate ARSvc

        %% ==========================================
        %% 3. LOAD RECEIVABLE DATA WITH USER SCOPE
        %% ==========================================

        ARSvc->>+ARStore: ListAsync(retailerUserId, ct)

        ARStore->>+ARStore: LoadAsync(retailerUserId, ct)

        ARStore->>+DB: SELECT scoped SalesOrders and Payments

        Note right of DB: Read payment allocations and collection history

        Note right of DB: Read related disputes and refund history

        DB-->>ARStore: Scoped receivable source data
        deactivate DB

        ARStore-->>ARStore: RetailerReceivableView collection
        deactivate ARStore

        ARStore-->>ARSvc: RetailerReceivableView collection
        deactivate ARStore

        %% ==========================================
        %% 4. BUILD RECEIVABLE RESULTS
        %% ==========================================

        loop For each scoped receivable

            ARSvc->>+ARSvc: ToResult(receivableView, today)

            Note right of ARSvc: Calculate outstanding and collectible balances

            Note right of ARSvc: Include collection, dispute and refund histories

            alt DueDate is past and collectible balance is positive

                Note right of ARSvc: Report Overdue

            else Payment is fully settled

                Note right of ARSvc: Report settled status

            else DueDate is not established

                Note right of ARSvc: Do not report Overdue

            else Receivable is not overdue

                Note right of ARSvc: Report current payment status

            end

            ARSvc-->>ARSvc: RetailerReceivableResult
            deactivate ARSvc

        end

        %% ==========================================
        %% 5. APPLY STATUS FILTER AND PAGINATION
        %% ==========================================

        ARSvc->>+ARSvc: NormalizeStatus(filter.Status)

        ARSvc-->>ARSvc: Normalized status
        deactivate ARSvc

        Note right of ARSvc: Apply requested filters and deterministic pagination

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% 6. RETURN SCOPED RECEIVABLE LIST
    %% ==========================================

    ARSvc-->>ARApi: RetailerReceivablePage or error
    deactivate ARSvc

    ARApi-->>Mobile: Receivables response
    deactivate ARApi

    Mobile-->>Retailer: Display receivables and outstanding balances
    deactivate Mobile

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 2 - VIEW PAYMENT HISTORY BY ORDER
    %% ==========================================

    opt Retailer selects one SalesOrder

        Note over Retailer,DB: PART 2 - VIEW SCOPED RECEIVABLE AND PAYMENT HISTORY

        Retailer->>+Mobile: Open SalesOrder payment history

        Mobile->>+ARApi: GetByOrder(orderId)

        ARApi->>+ARSvc: GetByOrderAsync(orderId, retailerUserId, ct)

        %% ==========================================
        %% 7. LOAD ORDER WITH RETAILER SCOPE
        %% ==========================================

        ARSvc->>+ARStore: FindByOrderAsync(orderId, retailerUserId, ct)

        ARStore->>+ARStore: LoadAsync(retailerUserId, ct)

        ARStore->>+DB: SELECT receivable data scoped to Retailer

        Note right of DB: Include Payment and related SalesOrder

        Note right of DB: Include PaymentReceipt allocations and collection history

        Note right of DB: Include dispute and refund information

        DB-->>ARStore: Scoped receivable source data
        deactivate DB

        ARStore-->>ARStore: RetailerReceivableView collection
        deactivate ARStore

        Note right of ARStore: Find matching SalesOrder within the scoped data

        ARStore-->>ARSvc: Matching ReceivableView or null
        deactivate ARStore

        %% ==========================================
        %% 8. CHECK ORDER VISIBILITY
        %% ==========================================

        alt Order does not exist or is outside Retailer scope

            Note right of ARSvc: Return Not Found without exposing another Retailer

        else Retailer can access this order

            %% ==========================================
            %% 9. EVALUATE CURRENT RECEIVABLE BALANCE
            %% ==========================================

            ARSvc->>+ARSvc: Today()

            ARSvc-->>ARSvc: Current business date
            deactivate ARSvc

            %% ==========================================
            %% 10. BUILD PAYMENT HISTORY RESPONSE
            %% ==========================================

            ARSvc->>+ARSvc: ToResult(receivableView, today)

            Note right of ARSvc: Calculate adjusted and confirmed payment amounts

            Note right of ARSvc: Calculate outstanding and overdue amounts

            Note right of ARSvc: Map ReceivableCollectionHistory

            Note right of ARSvc: Map ReceivableDisputeHistory

            Note right of ARSvc: Map ReceivableRefundHistory

            ARSvc-->>ARSvc: RetailerReceivableResult
            deactivate ARSvc

        end

        %% ==========================================
        %% 11. RETURN PAYMENT HISTORY
        %% ==========================================

        ARSvc-->>ARApi: RetailerReceivableResult or Not Found
        deactivate ARSvc

        ARApi-->>Mobile: Receivable details and financial histories
        deactivate ARApi

        Mobile-->>Retailer: Display collections, disputes and refunds
        deactivate Mobile

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% PART 3 - AUTHORIZED STAFF PAYMENT LOOKUP
    %% ==========================================

    opt Authorized staff views Payment by SalesOrder

        Note over Staff,DB: PART 3 - VIEW PAYMENT WITH ROLE AND ORDER SCOPE

        Staff->>+Portal: Open Payment details for SalesOrder

        Portal->>+PaymentApi: GetByOrder(orderId)

        PaymentApi->>+PaymentSvc: GetByOrderAsync(orderId, actorId, role, ct)

        %% ==========================================
        %% 12. VALIDATE READ ROLE
        %% ==========================================

        PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: ValidateReadRole(role)

        PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: Authorization result
        deactivate PaymentSvc

        alt Staff role is not authorized

            Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Forbidden

        else Staff role is authorized

            %% ==========================================
            %% 13. LOAD PAYMENT
            %% ==========================================

            PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: FindByOrderAsync(orderId, ct)

            PaymentStore->>+DB: SELECT Payment WHERE SalesOrderId = orderId

            DB-->>PaymentStore: PaymentView or null
            deactivate DB

            PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: PaymentView or null
            deactivate PaymentStore

            alt Payment does not exist

                Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Not Found

            else Payment exists

                %% ==========================================
                %% 14. CHECK ORDER ACCESS SCOPE
                %% ==========================================

                PaymentSvc->>+PaymentStore: CanViewAsync(orderId, actorId, role, ct)

                PaymentStore->>+DB: SELECT permitted SalesOrder access

                DB-->>PaymentStore: Access result
                deactivate DB

                PaymentStore-->>PaymentSvc: Authorized or Forbidden
                deactivate PaymentStore

                alt Staff cannot access this SalesOrder

                    Note right of PaymentSvc: Return Forbidden

                else Staff can access this SalesOrder

                    %% ==========================================
                    %% 15. BUILD PAYMENT RESULT
                    %% ==========================================

                    PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: Today()

                    PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: Current business date
                    deactivate PaymentSvc

                    PaymentSvc->>+PaymentSvc: ToResult(paymentView, today)

                    Note right of PaymentSvc: Calculate current payment status and balances

                    PaymentSvc-->>PaymentSvc: PaymentResult
                    deactivate PaymentSvc

                end

            end

        end

        %% ==========================================
        %% 16. RETURN PAYMENT RESULT
        %% ==========================================

        PaymentSvc-->>PaymentApi: PaymentResult or business error
        deactivate PaymentSvc

        PaymentApi-->>Portal: Payment detail response
        deactivate PaymentApi

        Portal-->>Staff: Display authorized Payment information
        deactivate Portal

    end

    %% ==========================================
    %% BUSINESS CONSTRAINTS
    %% ==========================================

    Note over ARSvc,DB: Retailer history must be restricted to the authenticated Retailer

    Note over ARStore,DB: Collections include allocations from consolidated PaymentReceipts

    Note over ARSvc,DB: Disputes and refunds are separate from confirmed collections

    Note over PaymentSvc,DB: Staff Payment access requires both role and order scope checks

    Note over ARSvc,DB: All operations in this diagram are read-only

    Note over ARSvc,DB: No PaymentReceipt, allocation or refund is created during retrieval